<title>PORTUGAL: Salomon sees Telecel '97 net 14.8 bln esc.</title>
<headline>Salomon sees Telecel '97 net 14.8 bln esc.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1997-03-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Salomon Bros said it estimated that Portuguese mobile phone operator Telecel would post a 1997 profit of 14.829 billion escudos.</p>
<p>A report recommended that Telecel shares should be held, based on a price of 13,700 escudos per share on February 14.</p>
<p>Telecel shares closed at 14,949 escudos, down 51, in volume of 81,929.</p>
<p>Telecel posted a net profit of 7.3 billion escudos in 1996, 199 percent more than in 1995.</p>
<p>-- Lisbon newsroom +351-1-3538254</p>
</text>
